atar editor\n- Fixed performance regression from last update\n- Adds 1x1 round plate\n- Fixes aliasing issues in main menu river scene\n- Fixes bug where some bricks would disappear after you left a world\n- Fixes collision bugs with 1x3 slope, 3x3 corner slope, 4x4 corner slope, and 1x1x2/3 slope\n- Fixes bug where large worlds could timeout while downloading\n- General performance improvements", "created_date": 1628783098, "id": "4415772671823002", "version": "0.2.40", "version_code": 38, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4018602774873329", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "6183588651708053"}, "release_status": "SCHEDULED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "431530467912721"}]}, "change_log": "Changelog: - Adds the ability to export your world to 3D models. The functionality is found in the room menu. - Adds small imperfections to the brick models - Change brick rendering to be more shiny and specular - Fix bug where usernames above heads weren't rendering in multiplayer - Fix bug where the slider on the brick menu would flicker in the tutorial", "created_date": 1628280419, "id": "4398186833581586", "version": "0.2.39", "version_code": 37, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4018602774873329", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "i